      "payload": {
        "progress": "De-risked in a throwaway repo copy (no repo changes). FINDINGS: (1) 'oxfmt --migrate=biome' generates .oxfmtrc.json preserving Biome's exact settings (printWidth 100, tabWidth 2, trailingComma all, semi, double quotes) — use it, don't hand-write the config. (2) ignorePatterns ['.slop/**','**/.slop/**','tests/fixtures/**'] PROVABLY protects the .jsonc db fixtures — verified md5-identical after a full format run. (3) Real diff with settings preserved: 26 files / ~1.1k lines, but 7 are src/web/views/* (~690 lines) which the shadcn SPA rewrite replaces anyway; the rest is tests/acceptance/C1,C3,D1 (it(name,fn) arg-layout style) + package.json. (4) NEW SCOPE DECISION NEEDED: oxfmt also formats markdown (docs/*.md), which Biome did NOT (its includes were src/**, tests/**, *.json, *.jsonc, .github/**) — either add docs markdown to ignorePatterns to keep scope identical, or accept md formatting deliberately. Recommend keeping scope identical initially. SEQUENCING: repo-wide reformat must run when NO agent worktrees are in flight."
      },
      "at": "2026-07-24T21:19:32.183Z"
