      "payload": {
        "progress": "Applied. KEY FINDING: oxfmt reflows html`` tagged templates as HTML, which CHANGES slop web's emitted output (broke 10 tests; reflowed text and lines around <pre><code> in the transcript viewer). Excluded src/web/views/** + html.test.ts for correctness, documented in config + DECISIONS; exclusion expires with the SPA rewrite. Also dropped organizeImports (proved it was never enforced: biome format doesn't run assist actions) and left sortImports off (goes further than biome ever did). Full gate green: 1950 tests, format/lint/typecheck clean."
      },
      "at": "2026-07-24T21:40:03.374Z"
